 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nCrestview Supplies LLC                             MASTER SERVICES\n1200 Industrial Parkway, 62701 Springfield, United States          AGREEMENT\nVAT No: US18-0892811\nReg No: US-005206\n\nFROM                                                     BILL TO\nCrestview Supplies LLC                                  Northwind Trading Inc\n1200 Industrial Parkway                                 88 Commerce Drive\n62701 Springfield                                       80201 Denver\nUnited States                                           United States\nVAT: US18-0892811\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 01/06/2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and\nbetween Crestview Supplies LLC, with its registered office at 1200 Industrial Parkway, Springfield (\"Party A\"), and\nNorthwind Trading Inc, with its registered office at 88 Commerce Drive, Denver (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 24 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in\naccordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the\npurposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by Swedish law.\n\nSignatures\nParty A    Crestview Supplies LLC / David Kim\nParty B    Northwind Trading Inc / Sarah Mitchell\nDate       01/06/2026",
